              "text": "<pre><code class=\"language-java\">Object <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">dequeue</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">()</span>\n{ <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(isEmpty()) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> head;\n  head=head.next;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(head==<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>) tail=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(p.info);\n}</code></pre>|||<pre><code class=\"language-java\">Object <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">dequeue</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">()</span>\n{ <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(isEmpty()) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> head;\n  head=head.next;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(head==<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>) tail=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(p.info);\n}</code></pre>"
